while there are many ways to do this the only rule is not to get
caught! of course, if you're really tough then you won't mind getting
caught but that's not the best strategy ...

[] 7. How do you a)bless items (any way other than through enchant
[] armor.weapon scrolls) 

note that all water is not created equal and they say that water has
many uses.

[] b)wish for specific items (like Stormbringer etc.)

when you get a wish, type:
a blessed +3 wide sword named Stormbringer
in the case of Stormy, and in general write the name of the object
_exactly_ as it might appear in your inventory.

[] c)should you #pray only when you need stuff, or every (I
[] think its 1000) turns.

i like to save my prayers for when i may need them, others have
different strategies. 1000 turns works on most occasions but it may
not and when that happens then who do you turn to?

[] 8. What good are blindfolds?

by going blind you invoke your sense of telepathy, a sort of third
eye which floats over the level and allows you to sense monsters.
you have to acquire telepathy (i can think of 4 ways). of course,
going blind also prevents you from looking at things you'd be better
off not seeing.

